  ],
  "answer": "To enable expert parallelism in vLLM for MoE models, set the `--enable-expert-parallel` flag. This will use expert parallelism instead of tensor parallelism for MoE layers, and the size is automatically calculated as `EP_SIZE = TP_SIZE × DP_SIZE`, where `TP_SIZE` is the tensor parallel size and `DP_SIZE` is the data parallel size."
}
